{"phase": "e_liu_T1", "day": 0, "kind": "day_attempt", "clicked": "金龍", "overlay": true, "presence": {"rec_star": ["luk_baakyin"], "cafe_cha": ["liu_bingxing"], "rec_hk": ["yip_manji"], "ad_adm": ["chung_choning"], "tvb_harbour": ["gu_mingfai"]}, "wf4": false}
{"phase": "e_liu_T1", "attempt": 0, "step": 0, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "liu_bingxing_surprise.webp", "name": "廖炳星", "line": "咦，隔籬枱嗰個後生仔，又係你呀？", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_liu_T1", "attempt": 0, "step": 1, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "liu_bingxing_base.webp", "name": "阿偉", "line": "前輩記得我呀？", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_liu_T1", "attempt": 0, "step": 2, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "liu_bingxing_smile.webp", "name": "廖炳星", "line": "記得，你嗰日笑到拍枱嘛。坐啦，唔使企到成碌木咁。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_liu_T1", "attempt": 0, "step": 3, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "liu_bingxing_base.webp", "name": "廖炳星", "line": "（眼尾都唔望）嗯，邊位呀？有事同副導講啦。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_liu_T1", "attempt": 0, "step": 4, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "liu_bingxing_think.webp", "name": "廖炳星", "line": "呢度啲奶茶，飲咗咁多年都係呢隻味，唔知係茶好，定係我念舊。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_liu_T1", "attempt": 0, "step": 5, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "liu_bingxing_base.webp", "name": "阿偉", "line": "前輩，你成日嚟呢度度橋㗎？", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_liu_T1", "attempt": 0, "step": 6, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "liu_bingxing_base.webp", "name": "廖炳星", "line": "卡位靜，又有啲人聲，度橋最啱。太靜反而諗唔到嘢。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_liu_T1", "attempt": 0, "step": 7, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "liu_bingxing_base.webp", "name": "伙記", "line": "星哥，老樣子，奶茶走糖呀？", "choices": []}
