{"phase": "e_lok_T2", "attempt": 0, "step": 1, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_shy.webp", "R": "lok_gasing_base.webp", "name": "阿偉", "line": "翻唱……聽眾鍾意，咪得囉？", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_lok_T2", "attempt": 0, "step": 2, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "lok_gasing_shy.webp", "name": "駱家聲", "line": "鍾意還鍾意，但電視台直情唔畀原創上大騷，話怕觀眾唔識欣賞。咁寫歌嗰啲人，係咪要餓死呀？", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_lok_T2", "attempt": 0, "step": 3, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "lok_gasing_base.webp", "name": "駱家聲", "line": "後生仔，借過下，我趕住入錄影廠。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_lok_T2", "attempt": 0, "step": 4, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "lok_gasing_base.webp", "name": "", "line": "1990年，星河電視台走廊，駱家聲啱啱喺高層房出嚟冇幾耐，火都未落，阿偉喺轉角撞返佢。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_lok_T2", "attempt": 0, "step": 5, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "lok_gasing_base.webp", "name": "駱家聲", "line": "你頭先都聽到晒啦？唔使扮冇聽到。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_lok_T2", "attempt": 0, "step": 6, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "lok_gasing_base.webp", "name": "阿偉", "line": "聽到少少……佢哋係咪又逼你唱人哋嘅歌呀？", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_lok_T2", "attempt": 0, "step": 7, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "lok_gasing_base.webp", "name": "駱家聲", "line": "逼我唱翻唱，仲要喺大騷度唱，話原創歌企唔到台中間，冇收視喎。", "choices": []}
